    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 900],
      "size": [750, 300],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "=== 입 모양별 프롬프트 및 설정 ===\n\n1. CLOSED (Denoising: 0.65)\n   Positive: \"anime character, closed mouth, lips together, calm neutral expression, simple clean mouth line, detailed face\"\n   Negative: \"open mouth, teeth showing, tongue visible, smile, multiple mouths\"\n\n2. NARROW (Denoising: 0.70)\n   Positive: \"anime character, narrow mouth, slightly open, thin lips, small mouth opening, speaking naturally\"\n   Negative: \"wide mouth, big smile, teeth, very open\"\n\n3. MEDIUM (Denoising: 0.70)\n   Positive: \"anime character, medium open mouth, natural speaking expression, moderately open lips\"\n   Negative: \"closed mouth, very wide mouth, extreme expression\"\n\n4. WIDE (Denoising: 0.75)\n   Positive: \"anime character, wide open mouth, happy expression, big cheerful smile, mouth open wide\"\n   Negative: \"closed mouth, sad, frown, neutral face\"\n\n5. O_SHAPE (Denoising: 0.70)\n   Positive: \"anime character, mouth shaped like letter O, round mouth, surprised oh expression, circular lips\"\n   Negative: \"closed mouth, smile, wide grin, teeth\"\n\n6. SMILE (Denoising: 0.65)\n   Positive: \"anime character, gentle smile, happy smiling mouth, upward curved lips, cheerful pleasant expression\"\n   Negative: \"sad, frown, neutral, crying, angry\"\n\n7. SAD (Denoising: 0.70)\n   Positive: \"anime character, sad mouth, frown, downturned lips, melancholic disappointed expression\"\n   Negative: \"smile, happy, cheerful, grin\"\n\n8. VERY_WIDE (Denoising: 0.80)\n   Positive: \"anime character, extremely wide open mouth, shocked surprised expression, mouth open very wide, yelling screaming\"\n   Negative: \"closed mouth, calm, normal expression, slight smile\"\n\n=== 사용 방법 ===\n1. 캐릭터 베이스 이미지 로드 (node 1)\n2. MediaPipe로 생성한 입 마스크 로드 (node 2)\n3. 각 입 모양에 맞게 프롬프트 변경 (node 4)\n4. Denoising 값 조정 (node 8)\n5. Seed 고정하여 일관성 유지 (node 8)\n6. 8번 반복하여 모든 입 모양 생성\n"
      ],
      "title": "📝 사용 가이드",
      "bgcolor": "#233"
    },
